<title>ITALY: SOCCER-URUGUAY'S RIVAS JOINS INTER AND THANKS GOD.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-URUGUAY'S RIVAS JOINS INTER AND THANKS GOD.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Uruguayan under-21 international defender Martin Rivas signed for Italy's Inter Milan on Tuesday and said the transfer deal was a gift from God.</p>
<p>&quot;God has answered my prayers,&quot; Italian agency ANSA quoted Rivas as saying. &quot;I hope that my mother (who died recently) will accompany me from heaven on this, my new adventure.&quot;</p>
<p>No-one at Inter was available to confirm the signing.</p>
</text>
